# Line endings are pinned here, not left to each machine's core.autocrlf.
# The laptop checks out with autocrlf=true and the desktop with false; a
# worker on the desktop committed every file it touched as CRLF (2026-09-15,
# worker/tsn-p3), which turned a three-line edit into a whole-file diff. Text
# is LF in the repository, whatever the box; Git converts on checkout where
# the box wants CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.xlsx binary
